<title>USA: Sportmart Inc stake cut by Harrosh.</title>
<headline>Sportmart Inc stake cut by Harrosh.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>California investor Joseph L. Harrosh said Monday he reduced his stake in Sportmart Inc to 8.8255 percent or 679,100 Class A non-voting shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, Harrosh said he sold a net of 13,500 shares on Feb. 7 at an average price of $2.9375 per share.</p>
<p>He holds the stake in the Wheeling, Ill., company for investment.</p>
